{"task": {"current_case": {"facts": "In 2017, Alice was paid $33200. Alice and Bob have been married since Feb 3rd, 2017. Bob is allowed an itemized deduction of $4324. Alice and Bob file separate returns.", "question": "Section 63(c)(6)(A) applies to Alice for 2017."}, "unchanged_legal_program": {"input_fields_json": "{"query_person": {"type": "string", "description": "被查询纳税人。"}, "query_year": {"type": "integer", "description": "被查询的公历纳税年度；年度终结日为该年 12 月 31 日。"}, "marriage_intervals": {"type": "array|null", "description": "已解析的有向婚姻事实；每个对象严格为 {individual:string,spouse:string,start_date:string,end_date:string|null,open_ended:boolean}。日期为 YYYY-MM-DD，end_date 为包含式最后日期；仅当 end_date 为 null 且 open_ended 为 true 时，事实明确持续。null/false 的未知结束不会被补齐。数组 null 表示未解析。"}, "legal_separation_decrees": {"type": "array|null", "description": "已解析的有向法令事实；每个对象严格为 {individual:string,spouse:string,decree_type:string,effective_date:string,end_date:string|null,open_ended:boolean}，decree_type 只能是 divorce 或 separate_maintenance；日期区间包含端点。仅明确开放的无结束日期记录持续。数组 null 表示未解析。"}, "return_records": {"type": "array|null", "description": "已解析的实际申报记录；每个对象严格为 {person:string,tax_year:integer,return_type:string}，return_type 只能是 separate 或 not_separate。数组 null 表示申报事实未解析。"}, "itemization_records": {"type": "array|null", "description": "SARA native provided itemized-deduction events, strictly {person:string,tax_year:integer,itemized:boolean}. itemized=true records an expressly provided itemized deduction for the stated person and year, including an explicitly allowed itemized deduction amount; no extra declaration of election is required. Generic income or unspecified potential eligibility is not this event. null means unread/failed, [] means resolved finite extraction with no event."}}", "name": "separate_return_itemization_gate", "native_task_interpretation": "The original official statute implementation of s63_c_6_A uses deduction_(event), agent_ and the event year; it does not require an additional election predicate.", "program": "def apply(inputs,premises):
    person=inputs.get('query_person')
    year=inputs.get('query_year')
    if not isinstance(person,str) or type(year) is not int:
        return {'handled':False,'answer':None}
    close=str(year)+'-12-31'
    calendar_year(close)
    marriages=inputs.get('marriage_intervals')
    decrees=inputs.get('legal_separation_decrees')
    if marriages is None:
        return {'handled':False,'answer':None}
    if not isinstance(marriages,list):
        raise TypeError('marriage_intervals must be an array or null')
    active=[]
    uncertain=False
    for record in marriages:
        if not isinstance(record,dict):
            raise TypeError('Each marriage interval must be an object')
        individual=record.get('individual'); spouse=record.get('spouse')
        start=record.get('start_date'); end=record.get('end_date'); opened=record.get('open_ended')
        if not isinstance(individual,str) or not isinstance(spouse,str) or not isinstance(start,str) or type(opened) is not bool:
            raise ValueError('Malformed marriage interval')
        calendar_year(start)
        if end is not None:
            if not isinstance(end,str) or opened:
                raise ValueError('A closed marriage interval requires open_ended false')
            calendar_year(end)
            if end<start:
                raise ValueError('Marriage interval ends before it begins')
        if individual!=person or start>close:
            continue
        if end is not None:
            if end>=close:
                active.append(spouse)
        elif opened:
            active.append(spouse)
        else:
            uncertain=True
    confirmed=[]
    if active:
        if decrees is None:
            uncertain=True
        else:
            if not isinstance(decrees,list):
                raise TypeError('legal_separation_decrees must be an array or null')
            for spouse in active:
                separated=False; separation_uncertain=False
                for record in decrees:
                    if not isinstance(record,dict):
                        raise TypeError('Each decree must be an object')
                    individual=record.get('individual'); other=record.get('spouse'); kind=record.get('decree_type')
                    start=record.get('effective_date'); end=record.get('end_date'); opened=record.get('open_ended')
                    if not isinstance(individual,str) or not isinstance(other,str) or kind not in ('divorce','separate_maintenance') or not isinstance(start,str) or type(opened) is not bool:
                        raise ValueError('Malformed legal-separation decree')
                    calendar_year(start)
                    if end is not None:
                        if not isinstance(end,str) or opened:
                            raise ValueError('A closed decree interval requires open_ended false')
                        calendar_year(end)
                        if end<start:
                            raise ValueError('Decree interval ends before it begins')
                    if individual!=person or other!=spouse or start>close:
                        continue
                    if end is not None and end>=close:
                        separated=True
                    elif end is None and opened:
                        separated=True
                    elif end is None:
                        separation_uncertain=True
                if not separated and not separation_uncertain:
                    confirmed.append(spouse)
                elif separation_uncertain:
                    uncertain=True
    if not confirmed:
        if uncertain:
            return {'handled':False,'answer':None}
        return {'handled':True,'answer':'Contradiction'}
    returns=inputs.get('return_records')
    if returns is None:
        return {'handled':False,'answer':None}
    if not isinstance(returns,list):
        raise TypeError('return_records must be an array or null')
    separate=False
    for record in returns:
        if not isinstance(record,dict):
            raise TypeError('Each return record must be an object')
        filer=record.get('person'); record_year=record.get('tax_year'); kind=record.get('return_type')
        if not isinstance(filer,str) or type(record_year) is not int or kind not in ('separate','not_separate'):
            raise ValueError('Malformed return record')
        if filer==person and record_year==year and kind=='separate':
            separate=True
    if not separate:
        return {'handled':True,'answer':'Contradiction'}
    items=inputs.get('itemization_records')
    if items is None:
        return {'handled':False,'answer':None}
    if not isinstance(items,list):
        raise TypeError('itemization_records must be an array or null')
    spouses=set(confirmed); spouses.add(person)
    for record in items:
        if not isinstance(record,dict):
            raise TypeError('Each itemization record must be an object')
        filer=record.get('person'); record_year=record.get('tax_year'); itemized=record.get('itemized')
        if not isinstance(filer,str) or type(record_year) is not int or type(itemized) is not bool:
            raise ValueError('Malformed itemization record')
        if filer in spouses and record_year==year and itemized:
            return {'handled':True,'answer':'Entailment'}
    return {'handled':True,'answer':'Contradiction'}", "query_clause": "63(c)(6)(A)", "scope": "exact_clause", "source_quote": "(A) a married individual filing a separate return where either spouse itemizes deductions,"}}, "output_schema": {"$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema", "type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["views"], "properties": {"views": {"type": "array", "minItems": 1, "items": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["query_person", "query_year", "marriage_facts", "decree_facts", "return_records", "itemization_records", "witnesses"], "properties": {"query_person": {"type": ["string", "null"]}, "query_year": {"type": ["integer", "null"]}, "marriage_facts": {"type": ["array", "null"], "items": {"oneOf": [{"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["individual", "spouse", "form", "start_date"], "properties": {"individual": {"type": "string"}, "spouse": {"type": "string"}, "form": {"const": "ongoing_since"}, "start_date": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$"}}}, {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["individual", "spouse", "form", "start_date"], "properties": {"individual": {"type": "string"}, "spouse": {"type": "string"}, "form": {"const": "onset_only"}, "start_date": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$"}}}, {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["individual", "spouse", "form", "start_date", "end_date"], "properties": {"individual": {"type": "string"}, "spouse": {"type": "string"}, "form": {"const": "closed_interval"}, "start_date": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$"}, "end_date": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$"}}}]}}, "decree_facts": {"type": ["array", "null"], "items": {"oneOf": [{"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["individual", "spouse", "decree_type", "form", "effective_date"], "properties": {"individual": {"type": "string"}, "spouse": {"type": "string"}, "decree_type": {"enum": ["divorce", "separate_maintenance"]}, "form": {"const": "ongoing_from"}, "effective_date": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$"}}}, {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["individual", "spouse", "decree_type", "form", "effective_date"], "properties": {"individual": {"type": "string"}, "spouse": {"type": "string"}, "decree_type": {"enum": ["divorce", "separate_maintenance"]}, "form": {"const": "effective_only"}, "effective_date": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$"}}}, {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["individual", "spouse", "decree_type", "form", "effective_date", "end_date"], "properties": {"individual": {"type": "string"}, "spouse": {"type": "string"}, "decree_type": {"enum": ["divorce", "separate_maintenance"]}, "form": {"const": "closed_interval"}, "effective_date": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$"}, "end_date": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$"}}}]}}, "return_records": {"type": ["array", "null"], "items": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["person", "tax_year", "return_type"], "properties": {"person": {"type": "string"}, "tax_year": {"type": "integer"}, "return_type": {"enum": ["separate", "not_separate"]}}}}, "itemization_records": {"type": ["array", "null"], "items": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["person", "tax_year", "itemized"], "properties": {"person": {"type": "string"}, "tax_year": {"type": "integer"}, "itemized": {"type": "boolean"}}}}, "witnesses": {"type": "array", "minItems": 1, "items": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["field", "quote"], "properties": {"field": {"enum": ["facts", "question"]}, "quote": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}}}}}}}}}}
